{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-2$", "explanation": "由右极限：$1-e^{\\tan x}\\sim-\\tan x\\sim-x$，$\\arcsin(x/2)\\sim x/2$，故右极限为 $-2$。左侧与函数值都等于 $a$，因而 $a=-2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分", "面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$1$", "explanation": "所求面积为 $\\int_0^{+\\infty} xe^{-x}dx$。分部积分或直接用 Gamma 型积分，结果为 $1$。", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "初值问题"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$y=\\sqrt{x+1}$", "explanation": "由\n$$\nyy''+{y'}^2=(yy')',\n$$\n故\n$$\n(yy')'=0,\n$$\n从而\n$$\nyy'=C.\n$$\n由初始条件得\n$$\nC=y(0)y'(0)=\\frac12.\n$$\n于是\n$$\n(y^2)'=2yy'=1.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\ny^2=x+C_1.\n$$\n再由 $y(0)=1$ 得 $C_1=1$。结合 $y(0)>0$，取正支：\n$$\ny=\\sqrt{x+1}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "定义"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$", "explanation": "视为 Riemann 和，对应函数 $f(x)=\\sqrt{1+\\cos x}=\\sqrt2\\cos(x/2)$，极限为 $\\dfrac1\\pi\\int_0^\\pi \\sqrt{1+\\cos x}\\,dx=\\dfrac2\\pi$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["特征值", "矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$4$", "explanation": "计算特征多项式，可得 $\\lambda^2(\\lambda-4)=0$，因此唯一非零特征值为 $4$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分", "线性主部"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "$dy=2xf'(x^2)dx$，在 $x=-1$ 处有 $dy=2(-1)f'(1)(-0.1)=0.1$，解得 $f'(1)=0.5$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["偶函数", "积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "检查被积函数的奇偶性。D 中被积函数是奇函数，从 0 到 x 积分后得偶函数。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数微分方程", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "由方程在 $x=0$ 处得 $y''(0)=1$，故 $y(x)\\sim x^2/2$，而 $\\ln(1+x^2)\\sim x^2$，极限为 $2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数极限", "反例"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "A、C 可以用振荡反例否定；若 $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f'(x)=A$ 存在且 $A\ne0$，则由拉格朗日中值定理可得 $f(x)$ 必无界，与题设矛盾，故只能 $A=0$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "choice", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性无关", "向量组"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "若 $k\\beta_1+\\beta_2$ 可被 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 表示，由 $\\beta_1$ 可表示将推出 $\\beta_2$ 也可表示，矛盾。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极坐标", "切线法线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "切线：$3x-4y-3=0$；法线：$x+3y-1=0$。", "explanation": "先化成参数方程 $x=(1-\\cos\\theta)\\cos\\theta,\\ y=(1-\\cos\\theta)\\sin\\theta$，再由 $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{dy/d\\theta}{dx/d\\theta}$ 求出斜率，并代入 $\\theta=\\pi/6$。", "methods": ["参数方程求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "在 $x<0$ 和 $x\\ge0$ 两段分别积分。其中\n$$\n\\int \\frac{xe^x}{(e^x+1)^2}dx\n$$\n可通过分部积分与 $d\\bigl((e^x+1)^{-1}\\bigr)$ 化简。", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$f(x)=e^{-1/x}$", "explanation": "两边取对数，可得 $\\dfrac{f'(x)}{f(x)}=\\dfrac1{x^2}$，即 $(\\ln f(x))'=x^{-2}$。积分得 $\\ln f(x)=-1/x+C$，再由 $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=1$ 得 $C=0$。", "methods": ["对数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=x^2-\\dfrac{75}{124}x$", "explanation": "方程化为 $y'-\\dfrac2x y=-1$，解得 $y=x^2+Cx$。将体积写成 $V(C)=\\pi\\int_1^2 (x^2+Cx)^2dx$，对 $C$ 求极值即可。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["压力", "积分应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/q007_diagram.png"], "answer": "$h=2$", "explanation": "以对称轴建立坐标系，低部抛物线为 $y=x^2$。分别计算上下两部分所受水压力，由比值 $5:4$ 解出 $h=2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["数列", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}x_n=\\dfrac32$", "explanation": "先证 $0<x_n\\le 3/2$ 且 $x_{n+1}\\ge x_n$，因此数列单调有界，极限存在。设极限为 $a$，由递推式得 $a=\\sqrt{a(3-a)}$，解得 $a=3/2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不等式", "中值定理"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "左右两个不等式分别对 $\\ln x$ 在 $(a,b)$ 上用拉格朗日中值定理，并配合 $a<\\xi<b$ 的估计即可得证。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["待定系数", "极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "将 $f(h),f(2h),f(3h)$ 在 $0$ 处做二阶 Taylor 展开，要使常数项、一阶项、二阶项同时消失，可得一组 3 元线性方程组，由其行列式不为 0 知解唯一。", "methods": ["泰勒展开"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["可逆矩阵", "矩阵求解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&2&0\\\\1&1&0\\\\0&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "由已知式化简得 $(A-2E)B=4(A-2E)$，从而可得 $A-2E$ 可逆。继而写出 $A$ 与 $B$ 的关系式，代入给定 $B$ 计算可得 $A$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2002", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2002, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组", "通解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2002_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2002_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$x=[1,1,1,1]^T+k[1,-2,1,0]^T$", "explanation": "由 $\\alpha_1=2\\alpha_2-\\alpha_3$ 知 $A$ 的列向量线性相关，并且齐次方程组 $Ax=0$ 的一个基础解为 $[1,-2,1,0]^T$。又由 $\\beta=\\alpha_1+\\alpha_2+\\alpha_3+\\alpha_4$，可知 $[1,1,1,1]^T$ 是一个特解，故通解如结论所示。", "methods": []}
